      ],
      "geometry": "rect",
      "text": "NLP/NER — spaCy pipeline fine-tuned on a custom oil & gas safety lexicon (permit-to-work, LOTO, confined space, hot work, H2S) — not a generic off-the-shelf model\nSIF classification — weak-supervision labeling (rule-based + LLM-assisted, validated against public CSB/OSHA incident investigation reports) feeding a lightweight classifier — addresses the \"no labeled data\" problem head-on instead of hiding it\nExplainability — evidence retrieval: each flagged report is paired with the specific extracted hazard/exposure terms and similar past incidents that drove the score\nSimilarity & clustering — sentence embeddings + density-based clustering (HDBSCAN) to group recurring hazard patterns\nCopilot — RAG grounded strictly in retrieved reports and evidence (no ungrounded generation)\nApp/infra — React, FastAPI, PostgreSQL + pgvector, Docker\n",
